Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,MY MOTHER-IN-LAW COUNTED THE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.71,0:00:03.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,CHAIRS. NINE. THERE ARE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:04.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,TEN OF US.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:05.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,SHE FORGOT WHO PAID
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:06.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,FOR THIS TABLE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:11.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,OH, PRIYA. I THOUGHT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:12.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,YOU WERE WORKING TONIGHT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.26,0:00:14.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,I TOOK THE NIGHT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:16.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,OFF. YOU KNEW THAT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.55,0:00:18.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,YOU CALLED MY BOSS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,TO CHECK.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.41,0:00:21.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,FAMILY DINNER IS FOR
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.21,0:00:23.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,FAMILY, DARLING. ETHAN UNDERSTANDS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:25.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,MOM... CAN WE NOT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.45,0:00:26.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,DO THIS TODAY?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.37,0:00:29.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,DO WHAT? I SIMPLY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:31.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,SET THE TABLE I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:32.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,CAN AFFORD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:34.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,ETHAN, TELL HER WHAT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:36.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,YOU SIGNED IN MARCH.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:38.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,THE HOUSE LOAN. PRIYA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:39.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,PAID IT OFF. THE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.97,0:00:41.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,DEED'S IN HER NAME
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:42.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,NOW.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.57,0:00:44.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,THAT'S NOT POSSIBLE. THIS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.63,0:00:46.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,IS MY HOUSE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.53,0:00:52.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,IT WAS. NOW IT'S
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.43,0:00:54.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,THE HOUSE I LET
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:55.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,YOU LIVE IN.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.15,0:00:58.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,SO. LET'S COUNT THE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:00:59.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,CHAIRS AGAIN.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.13,0:01:03.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,YOU WOULDN'T DARE.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:05.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,SHE WAS RIGHT. I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:06.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,WOULDN'T. NOT TONIGHT. TONIGHT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.74,0:01:08.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,I JUST WANTED MY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:09.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,SEAT. MONDAY, I WANTED
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.47,0:01:10.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,MY ANSWER.
